fa, https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1639b9e38828a51a5937386b784f84fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2414c4a/uploads/origins/4401a248-4a96-4f6b-89b8-b05cf67250c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b82a2fc05865539f10e23ef06c62b9c4 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei! I would love to request a commission for 2 of my OCs.\n\n(1) Noah/190cm\n\nHe has a sleeve that is tied as if you hide the right arm (details shown in the concept image). He appears to have a cold personality, which stems from his traumatic experiences. \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/118jb3GVZ_mbrstKwWa-Jk5fF_YyrSEqj\n\n(2) Valora/165cm\n\n She is a vampire huntress; she has a tomboyish and calm personality. You don’t have to include her sword.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/110k2yJBFHCuyXvHRoSUfceqgJoyqPOTZ\n\nTheir relationship is vampire and vampire huntress! They hate each other quite a bit. I have no mood required for this request, either a romantic or a creepy vibe, both are OK with me!\nAs for other elements, such as compositions, poses, etc., I will leave it entirely up to you! \n\nBoth of them have other outfits in the folder 'Variations'\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@UpsideDownBody/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e031aad9/uploads/origins/c6e89a04-778e-40db-a45a-3b2c4c858e3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be8ae2b09e5898184a15be4f063ee825", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e031aad9/uploads/origins/c6e89a04-778e-40db-a45a-3b2c4c858e3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=