ompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=667b7faec97ec00a5d31374a4c061700", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21b27c67/uploads/origins/90dc5114-4dd7-4aae-999b-15e10a39e657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=667b7faec97ec00a5d31374a4c061700, https://si.imgix.net/21b27c67/uploads/origins/90dc5114-4dd7-4aae-999b-15e10a39e657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba78b79f8b6eb5c1524d298d420a0803 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21b27c67/uploads/origins/90dc5114-4dd7-4aae-999b-15e10a39e657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=535b6ce6f92597c93265f2746a7b72fb 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I really love your work and would like to commission you to draw illustration for my OC characters.\nThere are two characters:\nFemale character: Rika\n\t•\tHeight: 161cm\n\t•\tBackstory: A novice nun turned into a doll after her death.\n\t•\tAppearance: Five moles and freckles on her face, deep brown eyes, grayish-brown braided twin buns.\n\t•\tPersonality: Raised in a convent, she’s skilled at listening to others’ troubles without emotion.\n\nMale character: Aki\n\t•\tHeight: 182cm\n\t•\tBackstory: A demon hunter from Hokkaido, seeking revenge for his family’s death by a demon.\n\t•\tAppearance: Water-colored eyes, neck-length hair tied up in life and let down as a doll, scars under his eyes, multiple ear and lip piercings.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/deoizz6uxt28mx9j8uxyb/AC6JXDVCVUCAgFCI9rWe7_E?rlkey=fg27446o7k40yuuxmjlbpt8jw&st=f1fr7omi&dl=0", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@UpsideDownBody/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3833253, "client_id": 930205, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88ef6015/uploads/origins/55dcfb39-9f44-4904-87c9-bd83c8346476?bg=%23ff